%% MUPP-024 Pictures are cached by the browser
flowchart TD
    A[Page built] --> B["img src = /bilder/id?v=version R1"]
    B --> C{Browser has it?}
    C -- yes --> D[Shown from the cache, no request]
    C -- no --> E[Request with cookie]
    E --> F{Cookie? R2}
    F -- no --> G[401]
    F -- yes --> H{v matches the picture? R1}
    H -- yes --> I[200, private max-age one year immutable]
    H -- no --> J[200, private no-cache]
    K[Picture replaced] --> L[New file name, new version, new address R1]
